{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260505/entry_horizontal_69fa754856e3a93ac74fffcf_1778021703741_640x360.jpg\"><p>冠城鐘錶珠寶供股集資逾1.45億元。</p><p>每股供股價0.1元，較上日收市價溢價逾三成一，供股比例3供1。集資所得不少於七成用於償還債務，餘額用作一般營運資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-05T23:20:14.802830+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}